# Requirements are LOCAL working artifacts — never committed.
#
# Everything added to this folder is ignored. Only this file and README.md
# (the folder's convention/protocol spec) are tracked, so the structure and
# the handoff contract survive a fresh clone while the actual feature
# requirements stay on the machine that produced them.
#
# To make the folder fully invisible to git, delete the two negations below.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
